## Required output shape

Finish by calling `ctx.done(output)`. The `output` you pass must be a string
holding exactly ONE JSON document that validates against this JSON Schema. No
prose, no explanation, and no code fence around it.

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "answer": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "The prose answer; cards carry the data, so keep it short"
    },
    "cards": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "description": "Card ids emitted this turn, in order"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "answer",
    "cards"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

